  "description": "Erection of a first floor extension to create a first floor studio flat above existing shop.",
  "site_name": "22",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "04/04/2005",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW3 4BJ",
  "street_name": "Spring Grove Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major all other major developments",
  "lapsed_date": "21/03/2010",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed creation of a 1st floor would provide satisfactory living space without harm to neighbours' living conditions or local traffic conditions. The development is in accordance with Unitary Development Plan policies ENV.B.1.1 (New Development), H.4.1 (Housing Standards), H.3.3 (Use of upper floors above shops in town centers) and the Council's Supplementary Planning Guidance.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 4 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 5 - Before the development is commenced a scheme for protecting the proposed residential accommodation from excessive external noise shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and any works which form part of such a scheme shall be completed before any part of the development is first occupied or used.",
    "Condition : 6 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of  9.00am           to  18.00pm           on Mondays to Friday and 8.00          to 13.00pm          on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - The access doorway to the ground floor unit shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle of not more than 1m above ground level."
  ],
